# xLaDe Scripts

This directory contains all the bash scripts used in xLaDe.
Any script used in CLI, experiments, workflows, tools, etc. must be put here.

---

## Scripts Idea

We intentionally use scripts/ directory for any script for centralised use.
If a script is inside an experiment or tool only, then it is restricted for use there only and difficult to find.
But with the script/ directory, people can find and use scripts easily.

---

## Caution

Please read the scripts before running.
Do NOT run arbitrary scripts blindly.

---
